type: software
title: "Scripts, conditions and results of 'What Makers Chose, and When: Noting the Quantities a Rule Leaves Open'"
abstract: >-
  Two series of reliefs made from the emotional values of words (tiles for the sentences of an English short story,
  portraits of six Japanese authors), with the scripts, the conditions committed before each computation, the results,
  and the note recording when each quantity left open by the rule was set. Supplement S3 of the article.
